    <item>
      <title>My blog has reached 100k&#43; total views, according to Busuanzi!</title>
      <link>https://dingjinyang.github.io/news/blog-100k-views/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:52:52 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://dingjinyang.github.io/news/blog-100k-views/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;According to &lt;a href=&#34;https://busuanzi.ibruce.info/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Busuanzi&lt;/a&gt;, my &lt;a href=&#34;https://comydream.github.io/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt; has now received more than 100,000 total views. By the time I noticed, the counter had already reached 106,914, so the 100k milestone must have been passed some time earlier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A small milestone, and a lovely reminder to keep writing.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
